WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.861
Here's what you'll be able to
do by the end of this module,

2
00:00:02.861 --> 00:00:05.225
which takes about fifty
minutes with the lab.

3
00:00:05.225 --> 00:00:09.065
You'll explain what
VK-INT-07 checks per GPO,

4
00:00:09.065 --> 00:00:12.575
and what the move plan adds per setting.

5
00:00:12.575 --> 00:00:16.575
You'll name the plan's dispositions,
and say what happens to a conflict.

6
00:00:16.575 --> 00:00:18.512
You'll describe a library file:

7
00:00:18.512 --> 00:00:22.075
the policy body Graph receives,
and the record around it.

8
00:00:22.075 --> 00:00:26.075
You'll run the dry run and the
apply, and read the sync record.

9
00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:29.013
And you'll explain why a
drift stops the release,

10
00:00:29.013 --> 00:00:31.725
and why the sync never
sends PATCH or DELETE.

11
00:00:31.725 --> 00:00:37.825
Before you start, do Module 2,
for how VK-INT-07 is built.

12
00:00:37.825 --> 00:00:42.463
Microsoft Automation Module
3 is optional background

13
00:00:42.463 --> 00:00:46.900
on the settings catalog and
Intune's v1.0 and beta APIs.

14
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:52.390
Lab 1 needs PowerShell 7.1 or
later and Pester 5, and no tenant.
